11:29.330 --> 11:29.830
Kak Yu.

11:30.200 --> 11:31.350
Aku masih ada sedikit urusan.

11:31.350 --> 11:32.280
Aku pulang dulu.

11:33.110 --> 11:33.470
Baiklah.

11:33.470 --> 11:33.840
Ya.

11:37.830 --> 11:38.590
Aku pergi dulu.

11:38.590 --> 11:38.990
Baik.

11:39.200 --> 11:39.630
Hati-hati.

11:39.630 --> 11:39.870
Ya.

11:40.230 --> 11:40.470
Ya.

11:45.040 --> 11:45.470
Ning.

11:46.920 --> 11:47.510
Ning...

11:51.200 --> 11:52.600
Aku tidak sengaja, Ning.

11:53.230 --> 11:54.170
