12:04.470 --> 12:05.160
Ning.

12:09.400 --> 12:10.200
Ning.

12:11.230 --> 12:11.830
Chen Fan.

12:12.320 --> 12:13.750
Tujuan utamaku sekarang adalah...

12:13.750 --> 12:15.280
Kuota pertukaran pelajar,

12:15.440 --> 12:16.110
